{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は新年初イベント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10福チェーン初売り合戦でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/06/3925846/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新星堂さん、\nHMVさん、\nキャラアニ.comさん\nタワーレコードさん、\nTSUTAYAさん、\nフタバ図書さん、\nヨドバシカメラさん\n山野楽器さん\n楽天BOOKSさん、\nWonderGOOさん\nの10チェーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコ生でやった「推しメン会議」で選ばれた\nそれぞれ10チェーンの応援メンバーが\n各店舗のレーンに別れて\nアルバムをお渡ししました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれの制服を着たよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/06/3925846/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/06/3925846/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃん、ちーちゃん、まりちゃ、中田\nの新星堂チームは\n新星堂エプロンに新星堂ネームカード！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDを渡す人\n学習ノートを渡す人\n袋を渡す人\n「ありがとうございました～」って言う人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に分担しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/06/3925846/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Cお渡し会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｃ:なーちゃん\n学:ちーちゃん\n袋:まりちゃ\nあ:中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Bお渡し会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｃ:中田\n学:なーちゃん\n袋:ちーちゃん\nあ:まり